@startuml
title FR-09 - Register Donor Profile - Activity Diagram

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Receptionist|
start
:Request registration of a new donor;

|Client|
:Display the required donor profile fields;

|Receptionist|
:Enter the required identifying\nand contact details;

|Server — Donors|
:Check completeness and validity\nunder the applicable rules;

if (Data missing or invalid?) then ([Yes])
  |Client|
  :Identify what must be corrected\nbefore registration;
  stop
else ([No])
endif

|Server — Donors|
:Look for an existing donor profile\nunder the applicable rules;

if (Existing profile found?) then ([Yes])
  |Client|
  :Display the existing profile;
else ([No])
endif

|Receptionist|
if (Cancel before saving?) then ([Yes])
  :Cancel registration;
  stop
else ([No])
endif

|Client|
if (Existing profile found?) then ([Yes])
  |Receptionist|
  :Use the existing profile;
  stop

else ([No])
  |Receptionist|
  :Click the save button;

  |Server — Donors|
  :Create the donor profile\nwith identifying and contact details;

  |Client|
  :Display the created donor profile;
  stop
endif

@enduml